{
  "category": "TC-EXPORT",
  "describes": "Section 8.2 portable bootstrap export — SHA-256 digest over the canonical serialization (§6) of the export object with `digest` omitted. Fully deterministic: an implementation reproduces `digest` from the inputs, and any tamper of artifact/pairing_token/ext_pub yields a mismatching digest (the runner proves both directions). Generated from the reference Phaedo.Export; runner: spec/test-vectors.mjs.",
